ost to collect and seamless scalability as providers grow their operations.​​​​‌﻿‍﻿​‍​‍‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​‍‌‍‍‌‌‍‌﻿‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿‍​‍​‍​﻿‍‍​‍​‍‌﻿​﻿‌‍​‌‌‍﻿‍‌‍‍‌‌﻿‌​‌﻿‍‌​‍﻿‍‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿﻿​‍​‍​‍﻿​​‍​‍‌‍‍​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌‍‌‍​‍​‍​﻿‍‍​‍​‍‌‍‍​‌﻿‌​‌﻿‌​‌﻿​​​﻿‍‍​‍﻿﻿​‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍​﻿‌‍​‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‍​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​﻿‍‍​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​‍﻿﻿‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​​‍﻿﻿‌‍‌‌‌‍‌​‌‍‍‌‌﻿‌​​‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‌‌‍﻿﻿‌‍‌​‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌﻿​​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌﻿​﻿‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍​‌‌﻿‌​‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‍​﻿‍﻿‌‍‍‌‌‍‌​​﻿﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​​​﻿​‍‌‍​‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌​‍﻿‌‌‍‌​​﻿‍​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​‍﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿‌‍​‍​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌‌‍​‌​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌​﻿​​​﻿‍​​﻿‌​​﻿‌​‌‍‌​‌‍​‌​﻿​‌​﻿​﻿​﻿‍‌​﻿​﻿‌‍​﻿​﻿‌‌​﻿‍﻿‌﻿‌​‌﻿‍‌‌﻿​​‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌‍​‍‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍‌﻿‌‌​​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​﻿‍﻿‌﻿​​‌‍​‌‌﻿‌​‌‍‍​​﻿﻿‌‌‍​﻿‌‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​﻿‌​​﻿​‌​﻿​‌‌‍‌​‌‍‌‍‌‍‌‌‌‍‌‍‌‍​‍​﻿​﻿‌‍​﻿​﻿​‍‌‍​‌​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌‍​﻿‌‍‍​‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‌​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍‌‍‌‍‌‍​‌​﻿‍​​﻿​​​﻿‌​​﻿‍‌​﻿‍‌​﻿‍‌​﻿‍‌‌‍‌​​﻿‍‌‌‍‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍​‌﻿‌​​﻿﻿﻿‌‍​‍‌‍​‌‌﻿​﻿‌‍‌‌‌‌‌‌‌﻿​‍‌‍﻿​​﻿﻿‌‌‍‍​‌﻿‌​‌﻿‌​‌﻿​​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​​‌​‍‌‌​﻿​‍‌​‌‍​‍‌‌​﻿​‍‌​‌‍‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍​﻿‌‍​‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‍​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​​‌​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​‍‌‍‌‍‍‌‌‍‌​​﻿﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​​​﻿​‍‌‍​‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌​‍﻿‌‌‍‌​​﻿‍​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​‍﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿‌‍​‍​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌‌‍​‌​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌​﻿​​​﻿‍​​﻿‌​​﻿‌​‌‍‌​‌‍​‌​﻿​‌​﻿​﻿​﻿‍‌​﻿​﻿‌‍​﻿​﻿‌‌​‍‌‍‌﻿‌​‌﻿‍‌‌﻿​​‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌‍​‍‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍‌﻿‌‌​​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​‍‌‍‌﻿​​‌‍​‌‌﻿‌​‌‍‍​​﻿﻿‌‌‍​﻿‌‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​﻿‌​​﻿​‌​﻿​‌‌‍‌​‌‍‌‍‌‍‌‌‌‍‌‍‌‍​‍​﻿​﻿‌‍​﻿​﻿​‍‌‍​‌​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌‍​﻿‌‍‍​‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‌​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍‌‍‌‍‌‍​‌​﻿‍​​﻿​​​﻿‌​​﻿‍‌​﻿‍‌​﻿‍‌​﻿‍‌‌‍‌​​﻿‍‌‌‍‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍​‌﻿‌​​‍‌‍‌﻿​​‌‍‌‌‌﻿​‍‌﻿​﻿‌﻿​​‌‍‌‌‌‍​﻿‌﻿‌​‌‍‍‌‌﻿‌‍‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌﻿​​‌﻿‌‌‌‍​‍‌‍﻿​‌‍‍‌‌﻿​﻿‌‍‍​‌‍‌‌‌‍‌​​‍​‍‌﻿﻿‌\n\n\n\"Candid's automation and our modern rules engine allow for accurate payment resulting from the first claim submission. Our top performing customers consistently achieve >95% first pass resolution and net collection rates,\" said Nick Perry, CEO and co-founder of Candid Health. \"Results like these are the reason we have seen such high adoption rates among providers and have caught the attention of industry authorities like MedTech Breakthrough.\"​​​​‌﻿‍﻿​‍​‍‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​‍‌‍‍‌‌‍‌﻿‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿‍​‍​‍​﻿‍‍​‍​‍‌﻿​﻿‌‍​‌‌‍﻿‍‌‍‍‌‌﻿‌​‌﻿‍‌​‍﻿‍‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿﻿​‍​‍​‍﻿​​‍​‍‌‍‍​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌‍‌‍​‍​‍​﻿‍‍​‍​‍‌‍‍​‌﻿‌​‌﻿‌​‌﻿​​​﻿‍‍​‍﻿﻿​‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍​﻿‌‍​‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‍​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​﻿‍‍​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​‍﻿﻿‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​​‍﻿﻿‌‍‌‌‌‍‌​‌‍‍‌‌﻿‌​​‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‌‌‍﻿﻿‌‍‌​‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌﻿​​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌﻿​﻿‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍​‌‌﻿‌​‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‍​﻿‍﻿‌‍‍‌‌‍‌​​﻿﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​​​﻿​‍‌‍​‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌​‍﻿‌‌‍‌​​﻿‍​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​‍﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿‌‍​‍​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌‌‍​‌​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌​﻿​​​﻿‍​​﻿‌​​﻿‌​‌‍‌​‌‍​‌​﻿​‌​﻿​﻿​﻿‍‌​﻿​﻿‌‍​﻿​﻿‌‌​﻿‍﻿‌﻿‌​‌﻿‍‌‌﻿​​‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌‍​‍‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍‌﻿‌‌​​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​﻿‍﻿‌﻿​​‌‍​‌‌﻿‌​‌‍‍​​﻿﻿‌‌‍​﻿‌‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍‌‍‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍‌​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​‍​﻿​﻿‌‍​‌​﻿‌‌​﻿‍‌‌‍​‍​﻿‌​‌‍‌‍​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌‍​﻿‌‍‍​‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‌​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍‌‍‌‍‌‍​‌‌‍‌​​﻿‌‍​﻿​‌​﻿‍‌‌‍​‌​﻿​​‌‍​﻿‌‍‌‍‌‍‌‍​﻿‍​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍​‌﻿‌​​﻿﻿﻿‌‍​‍‌‍​‌‌﻿​﻿‌‍‌‌‌‌‌‌‌﻿​‍‌‍﻿​​﻿﻿‌‌‍‍​‌﻿‌​‌﻿‌​‌﻿​​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​​‌​‍‌‌​﻿​‍‌​‌‍​‍‌‌​﻿​‍‌​‌‍‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍​﻿‌‍​‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‍​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​​‌​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​‍‌‍‌‍‍‌‌‍‌​​﻿﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​​​﻿​‍‌‍​‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌​‍﻿‌‌‍‌​​﻿‍​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​‍﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿‌‍​‍​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌‌‍​‌​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌​﻿​​​﻿‍​​﻿‌​​﻿‌​‌‍‌​‌‍​‌​﻿​‌​﻿​﻿​﻿‍‌​﻿​﻿‌‍​﻿​﻿‌‌​‍‌‍‌﻿‌​‌﻿‍‌‌﻿​​‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌‍​‍‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍‌﻿‌‌​​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​‍‌‍‌﻿​​‌‍​‌‌﻿‌​‌‍‍​​﻿﻿‌‌‍​﻿‌‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍‌‍‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍‌​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​‍​﻿​﻿‌‍​‌​﻿‌‌​﻿‍‌‌‍​‍​﻿‌​‌‍‌‍​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌‍​﻿‌‍‍​‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‌​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍‌‍‌‍‌‍​‌‌‍‌​​﻿‌‍​﻿​‌​﻿‍‌‌‍​‌​﻿​​‌‍​﻿‌‍‌‍‌‍‌‍​﻿‍​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍​‌﻿‌​​‍‌‍‌﻿​​‌‍‌‌‌﻿​‍‌﻿​﻿‌﻿​​‌‍‌‌‌‍​﻿‌﻿‌​‌‍‍‌‌﻿‌‍‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌﻿​​‌﻿‌‌‌‍​‍‌‍﻿​‌‍‍‌‌﻿​﻿‌‍‍​‌‍‌‌‌‍‌​​‍​‍‌﻿﻿‌\n\n\nA complex and adaptive payer landscape has proven challenging for legacy RCM vendors, where most automation providers only offer partial solutions that fail to meet the pace of change. In contrast, Candid's rules engine was built from the ground up, reimagining how to automate the complexity within the medical billing process by reverse-engineering hundreds of insurance rules continuously. With Candid's pre-configured rules as a foundation, providers can then overlay their own custom rules that satisfy the most nuanced use cases. The unparalleled combination of convenience and customizability from Candid ensures market-leading automation capabilities (including the most complex billing workflows), that reduce errors and denials while increasing claim accuracy and processing speed.​​​​‌﻿‍﻿​‍​‍‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​‍‌‍‍‌‌‍‌﻿‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿‍​‍​‍​﻿‍‍​‍​‍‌﻿​﻿‌‍​‌‌‍﻿‍‌‍‍‌‌﻿‌​‌﻿‍‌​‍﻿‍‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿﻿​‍​‍​‍﻿​​‍​‍‌‍‍​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌‍‌‍​‍​‍​﻿‍‍​‍​‍‌‍‍​‌﻿‌​‌﻿‌​‌﻿​​​﻿‍‍​‍﻿﻿​‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍​﻿‌‍​‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‍​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​﻿‍‍​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​‍﻿﻿‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​​‍﻿﻿‌‍‌‌‌‍‌​‌‍‍‌‌﻿‌​​‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‌‌‍﻿﻿‌‍‌​‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌﻿​​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌﻿​﻿‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍​‌‌﻿‌​‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‍​﻿‍﻿‌‍‍‌‌‍‌​​﻿﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​​​﻿​‍‌‍​‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌​‍﻿‌‌‍‌​​﻿‍​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​‍﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿‌‍​‍​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌‌‍​‌​﻿​‍​‍﻿‌​﻿​​​﻿‍​​﻿‌​​﻿‌​‌‍‌​‌‍​‌​﻿​‌​﻿​﻿​﻿‍‌​﻿​﻿‌‍​﻿​﻿‌‌​﻿‍﻿‌﻿‌​‌﻿‍‌‌﻿​​‌‍‌‌​﻿﻿‌‌‍​‍‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍‌﻿‌‌​​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​﻿‍﻿‌﻿​​‌‍​‌‌﻿‌​‌‍‍​​﻿﻿‌‌‍​﻿‌‍﻿﻿‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​﻿‌﻿​﻿‍‌​﻿‍‌‌‍​﻿​﻿​​‌‍​﻿​﻿‌‌​﻿​​​﻿‌‍‌‍​‌​﻿​﻿‌‍​‌​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌‍​﻿‌‍‍​‌‍‍‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‌​‌﻿​‍‌‍‌‌‌‍﻿‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​​‍‌‌﻿﻿‌‍‍﻿‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍‌​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​﻿​‌​﻿‍​‌‍‌​‌‍​﻿​﻿‌﻿‌‍​﻿​﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿​﻿‌‌​﻿​﻿​﻿‍​​‍‌‌​﻿​‍​﻿​‍​‍‌‌​﻿‌‌‌​‌​​‍﻿‍‌﻿‌​‌‍‌‌‌﻿‍​‌﻿‌​​﻿﻿﻿‌‍​‍‌‍​‌‌﻿​﻿‌‍‌‌‌‌‌‌‌﻿​‍‌‍﻿​​﻿﻿‌‌‍‍​‌﻿‌​‌﻿‌​‌﻿​​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​​‌​‍‌‌​﻿​‍‌​‌‍​‍‌‌​﻿​‍‌​‌‍‌‍﻿​‌‍﻿﻿‌‍​﻿‌‍​‌‌‍﻿​‌‍‍​‌‍﻿﻿‌﻿​﻿‌﻿‌​​‍‌‌​﻿​﻿‌​​‌​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​‍‌‍‌‍‍‌‌‍‌​​﻿﻿‌​﻿‌​​﻿‌﻿​﻿​﻿​﻿​​​﻿​‍‌‍​‌‌‍​‍​﻿‍‌​‍﻿‌‌‍‌​​﻿‍